0..69 Comment "// What `ua` refuses. `ua(e)` is admitted on the record\'s laws as its"
70..147 Comment "// evidence, so a record whose law does not hold builds no path: the law is a"
148..226 Comment "// field that does not check. The codes `ua` relates are codes of `Type`, so a"
227..305 Comment "// record between types one universe up is refused at its code. And `ua` after"
306..382 Comment "// `idtoequiv` is not the path by conversion, the law the model source owes."
384..459 Comment "// Two points, one point, the collapse of the first onto the second and the"
460..496 Comment "// map back with its one round trip."
